      "content": "i get that people say i should talk to someone but it just feels like more noise. like i'm just adding more weight to a world that's already so heavy. if everything is just going to keep spinning the same regardless of whether i'm in it or not... isn't it kind of rational to just stop fighting it? like, if i'm already invisible, why bother pretending there's a reason to stay?",
